#: ../../source/quickstart.rst:107
msgid ""
"MPI+OpenMP hybrid parallelization is available when calculating thermal "
"conductivity with ``MODE = RTA``, in which anharmonic self-energies of all "
":math:`N_{\\boldsymbol{q},irred}\\times N_{j}` phonon modes need to be "
"calculated. Here :math:`N_{\\boldsymbol{q},irred}` and :math:`N_{j}` are the "
"number of irreducible :math:`q` points and the number of phonon branches, "
"respectively. These phonon modes are distributed across ``NPROCS`` MPI "
"processes, and phonon self-energies are calculated in parallel. OpenMP is "
"used for the double loop over the :math:`N_{j}` branches inside the "
"calculation of each phonon self-energy. Therefore, good performance is "
"expected when ``OMP_NUM_THREADS`` is a divisor of :math:`N_{j}^{2}`."
msgstr ""
"``MODE = RTA`` による熱伝導率計算ではMPI+OpenMPハイブリッド並列が利用できます。この計算では、全 "
":math:`N_{\\boldsymbol{q},irred}\\times N_{j}` "
"フォノンモードの非調和自己エネルギーを計算する必要があります。ここで :math:`N_{\\boldsymbol{q},irred}` と "
":math:`N_{j}` はそれぞれ既約 :math:`q` 点の数とフォノン分枝の数です。これらのフォノンモードは ``NPROCS`` "
"個のMPIプロセスに分配され、フォノン自己エネルギーが並列に計算されます。各フォノン自己エネルギーの計算内部では、:math:`N_{j}` "
"分枝についての二重ループにOpenMPが使われます。したがって、``OMP_NUM_THREADS`` が :math:`N_{j}^{2}` "
"の約数のときに良い性能が期待できます。"

